Update:
the old generator still is best
new updates. trained a new model on (8c16c3decf88d93a5f5497d98ec87b1cef65eeed) with 100 epochs (trained only for 60) performed the best. Also, the 'best' model according to yolo was 30th epoch model but it performed worse on eval.py.
it seems that it would be best not to use patience and train the model for 50-90 epochs.

